From: pocket-debs <masterxq@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 25 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] history: photo of the contact, call back with one tap
Description:
 Each entry of the call history shows the photo of the contact (a
 placeholder for a number that is not in the contacts) with the direction
 of the call (incoming, outgoing, missed) as badge; the badge is a disc
 with an outline, readable on any photo. A tap on the photo opens the
 contact in the contact view, or the view for a new contact with the
 number. The name (else the number) is shown with the number and the time
 and duration of the call; the date is the section. A tap on the entry or
 on the flat call button at its end calls the number back right away (it
 put the number into the dial pad before).
 .
 Builds on the contact view, the row buttons and the contact lookup
 (patches 0001 to 0003 of this series).
Forwarded: no
License: LGPL-2.0-or-later (as the patched file)
Last-Update: 2026-11-25
---
--- a/plasma-dialer/src/qml/history/HistoryDelegate.qml
+++ b/plasma-dialer/src/qml/history/HistoryDelegate.qml
@@ -5,72 +5,123 @@ import QtQuick
 import QtQuick.Layouts
